149
00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:24.038
Loneliness will soon be
a thing of the past.

150
00:08:25.706 --> 00:08:28.042
What do you think
about that. Circe?

151
00:08:29.810 --> 00:08:33.047
Well. I think that's just swell.

152
00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.615
Jesus.

153
00:08:34.648 --> 00:08:35.816
TERRANCE:
Impressive.

154
00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:38.619
