174
00:09:28.936 --> 00:09:31.806
-"S-Soulmate."
-"Soulmate."

175
00:09:31.839 --> 00:09:33.841
-Impressive. huh?
-Ah. it's amazing.

176
00:09:33.874 --> 00:09:35.976
-Yeah.
-DAVID: Yeah.

177
00:09:38.646 --> 00:09:39.980
That's enough. Circe.

178
00:09:40.014 --> 00:09:41.348
