192
00:10:15.382 --> 00:10:16.717
(laughs)

193
00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:18.252
You know what inspires me?

194
00:10:18.285 --> 00:10:19.987
You know why I took this job?

195
00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:21.255
The nice salary?

196
00:10:21.288 --> 00:10:23.090
(both laugh)

197
00:10:23.124 --> 00:10:24.792
I took this job

198
00:10:24.825 --> 00:10:28.696
