it would help people.

209
00:10:58.792 --> 00:11:00.761
Wow. (chuckles)

210
00:11:00.794 --> 00:11:02.062
(sighs)

211
00:11:02.096 --> 00:11:04.932
That is really.
really admirable. David.

212
00:11:07.268 --> 00:11:09.136
That's Elizabeth. right?

213
00:11:11.238 --> 00:11:13.140
Lizzie.

214
00:11:13.174 --> 00:11:15.309
Yeah.

215
00:11:15.342 --> 00:11:16.877
How'd you know her name?

216
00:11:17.678 --> 00:11:19.947
