get back to it.

225
00:11:42.469 --> 00:11:46.373
David. have you ever used
our ULTI-M8TE chat app?

226
00:11:46.407 --> 00:11:49.076
Uh. no. No. I have not.

227
00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:53.214
BEN: All our employees get
a full free membership.

228
00:11:53.247 --> 00:11:55.349
There's a lot of people
who've found it helpful

229
00:11:55.382 --> 00:11:56.850
