230
00:11:58.252 --> 00:12:00.154
...without judgment.

231
00:12:00.187 --> 00:12:01.822
Okay. Thanks.

232
00:12:01.855 --> 00:12:04.925
♪ ♪

233
00:12:07.294 --> 00:12:09.797
