slip out on this one.

241
00:12:53.774 --> 00:12:55.376
You don't have to drag me out.

242
00:12:55.409 --> 00:12:56.944
-I-I'm coming.
-Okay.

243
00:12:56.977 --> 00:12:59.246
We're leaving in five.

244
00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:00.414
Okay.

245
00:13:00.447 --> 00:13:03.917
