246
00:13:03.951 --> 00:13:06.554
TERRANCE: ♪ No. no. no. no.
I will survive ♪

247
00:13:06.588 --> 00:13:08.022
Come on. now!

248
00:13:08.055 --> 00:13:10.157
♪ As long as I know
how to live ♪

249
00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:12.594
♪ I know I'll stay alive ♪

250
00:13:12.627 --> 00:13:14.295
♪ I've got all my love to give ♪

251
00:13:14.328 --> 00:13:16.297
♪ And I got so much love
to give ♪

252
00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:17.364
♪ I will survive ♪

253
00:13:17.398 --> 00:13:18.432
Come on. y'all!

254
00:13:18.465 --> 00:13:20.134
♪ I will survive ♪

255
00:13:20.167 --> 00:13:24.438
(falsetto):
♪ I will survive... ♪

256
00:13:24.471 --> 00:13:27.908
